machine. Drop a Cat Coin to hunt down every last Rat Coin and rack up extra tickets. Need more points? Use a MultiCoin to boost your score across the board. Too slow? Blast a TNT Coin to trigger a massive explosion and blast every coin forward at once!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.poster.avif?t=1768404511\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.webm?t=1768404511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/01bebf0bef78f426032a1c844b8e4828.mp4?t=1768404511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/b54fdfc04f9a0560363a0bfa8872423f.avif?t=1768404511\" width=1228 height=257 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover over 120 unique items that can dramatically shift the course of your run. Stack multipliers, spawn coins with extra points, or simply shake the machine when you're running dry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply special plating to your favorite coins to enhance their effects and unlock even wilder combos.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.poster.avif?t=1768404511\" width=780 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.webm?t=1768404511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/077081d5d0c676423ff7dbf00ac930e6.mp4?t=1768404511\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/218cca93c7337e2264e04f50f4c06769.avif?t=1768404511\" width=1228 height=280 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as one of several unique characters, each with their own set of themed coins and playstyle. Take on the role of a greedy raccoon manager who excels at math-based combos, or a quirky biologist who specializes in animal-based coins. Every character offers a fresh and wildly different way to play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.poster.avif?t=1768404511\" width=780 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/64c96b7635c74842e1ca1da9410fbf4c.webm?t=1768404511\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/extras/40bd9fec16e9ccadddab085560c162ef.avif?t=1768404511\" width=1560 height=290 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 playable characters, each with their own unique coins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >130+ distinct coins with special effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >120+ power-up items with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless run mode for infinite replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 difficulty levels to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Doraccoon "],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784030/441ff79feb6f3e92a5a6ed4a1d4b89c79e275644/header.jpg?t=1768404511","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/720625780/b9c18d8627db62b1446cb4d0c3a8df71e244580d/1762767149/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762772610","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/720625780/b9c18d8627db62b1446cb4d0c3a8df71e244580d/1762767149/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762772610","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/720625780/b9c18d8627db62b1446cb4d0c3a8df71e244580d/1762767149/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762772610","id":257229039,"name":"RACCOIN - Gameplay video - play demo","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257229039/9896be99adfdd41926bd0114ff8872dcc98582e2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1762772610"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/511446333/07a78181458396f877563271eae87f44646071ae/1755081948/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768404509","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/511446333/07a78181458396f877563271eae87f44646071ae/1755081948/dash_h264.mpd?t=1768404509","highlight":false,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3784030/511446333/07a78181458396f877563271eae87f44646071ae/1755081948/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1768404509","id":257182560,"name":"Raccoin Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257182560/258c8c785a472424647e2d2c893516683b0cdd66/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1768404509"}],"name":"RACCOIN: Coin Pusher Roguelike","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong>